        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He! Kandi khou bamsaan khou hei,",
            "Rianra mei rui duamliam the;",
            "Theihmei Jordan dui kaanpat maksan,",
            "Poubaomei rui lunggei bam e.",
            "",
            "He! Tithailou o, dam lou pui ram,",
            "‘Zianmei le kauh lat diu bam ntam makpui ram,",
            "Kandi rianra ram pat louna;",
            "He! Tabui nung rui guang tang nicho?",
            "",
            "2. Rei khou rianrana bammei guai,",
            "Kagun daihpui ran tangh khou;",
            "Tatreimei le kauh banchara guai rui,",
            "He! Nzaenghmei Guangh ta thuanku e.",
            "",
            "3. Katingsaeng lu suan chamh khang ttei,",
            "Kau e nthanmei nun rui;",
            "Kakhuan gaimei tei chulouna ai,",
            "Hei ram gaimei tei ninga kap be.",
            "",
            "4. Ningtan makge Immanuel:",
            "Damthanh mei Jerusalem;",
            "Kandih heimu rianrapui ram e,",
            "Tang lakni thei ping e zailou o."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
